<title>USA: Specialty Chemical gets credit pact.</title>
<headline>Specialty Chemical gets credit pact.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialty Chemical Resources Inc said Monday it has a revolving credit agreement with Star Bank that provides a $12 million credit line.</p>
<p>The agreement, entered into on September 18 and expiring December 31, replaced the company's $10 million credit facility with National City Bank.</p>
